DataViz API.

USAGE:
  scw dataviz <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  deployment  Manage your DataViz deployment
  endpoint    Manage your DataViz deployment endpoints
  node-type   List available node types
  user        Manage your DataViz deployment users
  version     List your DataViz versions

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for dataviz
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use

Use "scw dataviz [command] --help" for more information about a command.
